# Current documentation example compilation preparation

**Authoritative extraction: `validation/examples/v2/`. Prepared, not compiled or executed.**
Sol, 2026-11-04. Ownership is limited to this record and `validation/examples/`; no
hardware-probe files or coordinator validation/manifest tools were changed. No builds,
tests, formatter, hardware, commits or agents were run. No Core/other-module implementation
was read. This is compilation preparation, not a content-review or hardware verdict.

